# request: "C4 context diagram of the online shop for the onboarding doc.
#  Customers place orders and staff manage the catalog, both over HTTPS. The
#  shop charges cards with Stripe, sends receipts through SendGrid, buys
#  shipping labels from EasyPost and exports orders to the ERP every night
#  over SFTP. No internals. Highlight the shop."
type: context
reader: new engineers reading the onboarding doc
width: 800
direction: down
focus: shop  # "Highlight the shop"
out: containers and internals (c4 view), admin tooling, monitoring
nodes:
  customer: Customer\n[Person] {shape: c4-person}
  staff: Staff\n[Person] {shape: c4-person}
  shop: Online shop\n[Software System]
  stripe: Stripe\n[Software System] {external}
  sendgrid: SendGrid\n[Software System] {external}
  easypost: EasyPost\n[Software System] {external}
  erp: ERP\n[Software System] {external}
edges:
  customer -> shop: Places orders [HTTPS]
  staff -> shop: Manages the catalog [HTTPS]
  shop -> stripe: Charges cards [HTTPS]
  shop -> sendgrid: Sends receipts [HTTPS]
  shop -> easypost: Buys labels [HTTPS]
  shop -> erp: Exports orders nightly [SFTP] {dashed}
